    {
      "id": "u_432d337bb92048b9a484a781_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ which applies transforms: rotate (90 / 180 / 270) and flip horizontal/vertical. Only one transform can be used per icon.",
